# LearnStack Hub — Leakwatch path ignores.
#
# Glob syntax (same as .gitignore). Each entry must cite WHY the path
# carries intentional dev-only literals; production never reads from these
# files, and every production credential surface goes through `ISecretProvider`.
#
# Prefer inline `# leakwatch:ignore` over .leakwatchignore for single
# literals — path-level exclusion turns off EVERY detector on the file.

# ─── Env templates (carry placeholder shapes, never real secrets) ───────
